# ${SRC_DIR}/lib/

Framework-agnostic primitives for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- [`ttl-cache.ts`](ttl-cache.ts) — in-process TTL Map with FIFO eviction (1,000 entries by default). Pass a second constructor argument to change capacity. Zero TTL invalidates a key.
- [`retry.ts`](retry.ts) — capped exponential-backoff retry helper. Use only for operations that are safe to repeat; options are validated before calling the operation.
- [`stringUtils.ts`](stringUtils.ts) — string helpers (slug, truncate).

## What does NOT live here

- Anything that imports from `middlewares/`, `models/`, or `api/`. `lib/` is
  a leaf module — it depends on nothing inside this project except itself
  and approved third-party packages.
- HTTP middleware. Use `${SRC_DIR}/middlewares/`.
- Business logic. Use a feature's `services/`.

## Naming

- Lowercase, hyphen- or camelCase one-concept-per-file (`ttl-cache.ts`,
  `retry.ts`, `stringUtils.ts`).
- Tests sit in `${SRC_DIR}/tests/unit/` with the matching `*.spec.ts` suffix.

